Sampati recalls sage blessing and hundred-year wait on Vindhya --- Restrains death resolve with sage words amid burning grief --- Laments hearing Sita wail and failing to save her --- Sprouts new wings before the monkeys --- Rejoices in restored youth, strength and flight --- Urges monkeys to strive for Sita, citing wings as omen --- Sampati tests wings from mountain peak --- Monkeys set out wind-swift to seek Sita